'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include ../shortfall/readable.iuml
title Rejecting reset arguments
actor User
participant "mishMash:MishMash" as App
participant "parser:Parser" as Parser
User -> App : reset-plan d/1
App -> Parser : parseCommand(input)
Parser -> Parser : parseResetPlan("d/1")
Parser --> App : throws MishMashException
App -> User : display error, reset usage, and next prompt
note over App, Parser
 No reset command is created.
 All session data stays unchanged.
end note
User -> App : reset-plan
ref over App, Parser : Valid parsing, then confirmation if needed

@enduml
'@@author
